WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:06.788
First: when is the V P N route for
a migrated application removed?

3
00:00:06.788 --> 00:00:10.711
The answer is b: only after the
wave holds, with the V P N's own

4
00:00:10.711 --> 00:00:15.387
logs showing no traffic for that
application for ten business days.

5
00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:18.749
Second: in the guide's
rollback, what comes last?

6
00:00:18.749 --> 00:00:23.721
The answer is c: disabling signaling,
only after no policy depends on it;

7
00:00:23.721 --> 00:00:26.463
turning it off earlier can block users.

8
00:00:26.463 --> 00:00:31.440
The module page has three more questions,
each linked to the unit that answers it.
